<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Daehan Flour seeks 21,000T of U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Daehan Flour seeks 21,000T of U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daehan Flour Mills Co Ltd has invited tenders to buy 21,000 tonnes of U.S. No.1 wheat by 2:00 p.m. (0500 GMT) on Friday, a company official said on Thursday.</p>
